{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:QOU.Hecke.TwRep","@type":"LeanModule","name":"QOU.Hecke.TwRep","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:QOU.Hecke.TwBasisBraid","lean:module:QOU.Hecke.TwSpanning","lean:module:QOU.Hecke.IwahoriHecke"],"declarations":9,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Hecke.TwBasis.orbitMap_surjective","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Hecke.TwBasis.orbitMap_surjective","kind":"theorem","line":109,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Hecke/TwRep.lean#L109-L113","doc":"**`S_{n+1} →₀ K` is a cyclic `H_n(q)`-module, generated by `T_1`.**\nEquivalently, the `T_w` span the module — the first half of the basis\ntheorem.  (Their independence is the other half, and is not proved here.) ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Hecke.TwBasis.single_mem_range_orbitMap","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Hecke.TwBasis.single_mem_range_orbitMap","kind":"theorem","line":99,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Hecke/TwRep.lean#L99-L107","doc":"Every basis vector `T_w` is in the image of the orbit map. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Hecke.TwBasis.orbitMap_apply","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Hecke.TwBasis.orbitMap_apply","kind":"theorem","line":96,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Hecke/TwRep.lean#L96-L97","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Hecke.TwBasis.orbitMap","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Hecke.TwBasis.orbitMap","kind":"def","line":88,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Hecke/TwRep.lean#L88-L94","doc":"The orbit map `h ↦ h · T_1`, sending an element of `H_n(q)` to its action on\nthe basis vector indexed by the identity. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Hecke.TwBasis.toEnd_σ","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Hecke.TwBasis.toEnd_σ","kind":"theorem","line":81,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Hecke/TwRep.lean#L81-L86","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Hecke.TwBasis.toEnd","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Hecke.TwBasis.toEnd","kind":"def","line":75,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Hecke/TwRep.lean#L75-L79","doc":"**The Hecke algebra acts on the free module on `S_{n+1}`.**  `H_n(q)` maps\nto the endomorphisms of `S_{n+1} →₀ K`, generator by generator. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Hecke.TwBasis.freeToEnd_rel","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Hecke.TwBasis.freeToEnd_rel","kind":"theorem","line":57,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Hecke/TwRep.lean#L57-L73","doc":"**The defining relations are satisfied by the `Rs`.** ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Hecke.TwBasis.freeToEnd_ι","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Hecke.TwBasis.freeToEnd_ι","kind":"theorem","line":53,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Hecke/TwRep.lean#L53-L55","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Hecke.TwBasis.freeToEnd","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Hecke.TwBasis.freeToEnd","kind":"def","line":48,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Hecke/TwRep.lean#L48-L51","doc":"The lift of the generators to `End` before the relations are imposed. ","signatureChunk":0}]}